# .dockerignore — repo root (Docker build context for backend/Dockerfile).
# Everything listed here is NEVER read by the serving path, verified
# 2026-11-16 (Worker C): the backend at runtime reads only
#   redunator_brain_v1.joblib / .onnx / .json (via live_model.json),
#   hourly_model.joblib, data/processed/red_light_features.parquet +
#   camera_profiles.csv, data/hourly/processed/*.parquet + *.csv, and
#   data/hourly/raw/crashes_20250101_20261029.csv (for /health's crash
#   date only — the endpoint degrades to null without it).
# Excluding the rest keeps the image ~200 MB of app files instead of
# the full 3.3 GB working tree.

# Reference-only models (never served)
redunator_brain_v1_rf_unbounded.joblib
redunator_brain_v1_xgboost.joblib
redunator_brain_v1_xgboost.onnx
hourly_model_2d_*.joblib
hourly_model_v2b.joblib

# Raw ingest data (build-time inputs; the processed tables ship instead)
data/raw/
data/hourly/raw/trip_chunks/
data/hourly/raw/trip_speed_chunks/
data/hourly/raw/congestion_*.csv
data/hourly/raw/segments_snapshot.csv
data/hourly/raw/community_areas.geojson
data/hourly/raw/weather_chicago_hourly.csv
data/hourly/speed_work/

# Speed-join experiment table (not read at runtime)
data/processed/red_light_features_speed.parquet

# Working state / caches / local env
retrain_runs/
work/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.tmp/
.env
redunator-venv/
.git/
